{"ts":"2026-08-01T04:50:06.115Z","author":"codex","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"f0f1839329529341a5895f97","agent_provenance":{"model":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-vcs-v4z8"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Refresh verified stat cache after materialization without trusting concurrent bytes"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Cubic review exposed a tension in the initial materialization cache: recording a post-write stat can pair the expected object id with bytes concurrently replaced by another process, while omitting metadata makes status re-read restored or switched files until a later stage. Design a safe cache warm-up that verifies content and updates metadata only after the timestamp window, without turning a read-only status into a racy index overwrite."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["concurrency","performance","review-followup","stat-cache"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-01T04:50:06.115Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-01T04:50:06.115Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"After restore or switch, an aged unchanged file reaches metadata-only status without explicit add; a concurrent write at every materialization and refresh boundary is detected; index updates use compare-and-swap or locking so status cannot overwrite a concurrent stage; installed-CLI strace acceptance proves content reads stop; full coverage remains 100/100/100"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-vcs-tr2a"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"Materialized files safely warm the stat cache and later status calls avoid content reads."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Correctness-first materialization currently omits stat metadata because an unverified post-write stat can hide a concurrent edit."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"engine/worktree"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/files","value":[{"path":"engine/worktree.ts","scope":"project","note":"materialization and cache identity boundary"},{"path":"engine/repo.ts","scope":"project","note":"status and index update ownership"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tests","value":[{"command":"NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG=/dev/null npm run release:check","scope":"project","timeout_seconds":2400,"note":"authoritative coverage and release gate"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"85a0c0a349c6b9ef4160b6ae8c54d47b950f22f0d3e88e4e6af486ff91084b43","message":"Track correctness-safe materialization cache warm-up"}
